          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_16",
        on: "branch_if_16",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "units_to_slay",
            greater_than: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Alric",
            text: _("A humiliating defeat, yet you are no match for the might of the Clan!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Sir%20Alric%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "clan_alric",
            value: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_16",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_19",
        on: "branch_if_19",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "units_to_slay",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We are routing their forces! Let’s see if the Clan has had enough. Their help in guarding our flanks will be invaluable."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "clanboss",
            text: _("Stop! I cannot believe this! You have defeated us! Indeed, you are worthy, worthy even to claim the throne. The clans will help you. We will fight with you against the Queen."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("So you admit defeat! You will serve me in fighting the evil queen?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "clanboss",
            text: _("We will serve you, my lord. You will make a worthy king."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The mighty riders of the eastern plains, the Knights of the Clans, are now yours to command!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Knight",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("I think you are mistaken! You will help me be queen."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "clanboss",
            text: _("Who then is your leader? Whom do we serve?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("You will serve us. You will protect our flanks while we make way straight for the Queen. With you on either flank, we can surely overcome her."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Delfador, don’t you think it is time we settled this?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Yes, it is time. It is time for the truth to be told. I had hoped to take this secret to my grave, but it isn’t to be. You elves live too long, and though I have tried hard to understand, your wisdom is foreign to me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Secret? What secret, Delfador? What are you talking about?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We should not speak of it now. Instead come with me, Konrad and Li’sar, to the top of Mount Elnar. To look at Weldyn. To make plans for the battle, and to talk."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
